    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in unfamiliar environment. Nowhere to go, and the only clue are those strange rune stones. Try to find out what to do next. Your guide? A rabbit with violence issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet Another One is a short, free to play game, focused around one mechanic: drawing runes. You can use them to enhance your movement, light up the surroundings,\u00a0 teleport or shoot lightnings! Solve puzzles, evade enemies, and find the exit! Try different ways to use each one, or even a few of them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.poster.avif?t=1743582175\" width=622 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.webm?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.mp4?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.poster.avif?t=1743582175\" width=608 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.webm?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.mp4?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in unfamiliar environment. Nowhere to go, and the only clue are those strange rune stones. Try to find out what to do next. Your guide? A rabbit with violence issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet Another One is a short, free to play game, focused around one mechanic: drawing runes. You can use them to enhance your movement, light up the surroundings,\u00a0 teleport or shoot lightnings! Solve puzzles, evade enemies, and find the exit! Try different ways to use each one, or even a few of them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.poster.avif?t=1743582175\" width=622 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.webm?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/2714d6b61afcf9de896cd4ef81dbb4ab.mp4?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.poster.avif?t=1743582175\" width=608 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.webm?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594210/extras/428410d2e2b45a85c8c91d4d08f35722.mp4?t=1743582175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
